2105
01:23:39.220 --> 01:23:40.780
but it was in the background,

2106
01:23:40.780 --> 01:23:43.877
but I could feel there's some shit that's fucking not me

2107
01:23:43.877 --> 01:23:45.350
that makes me, wants me wanna drink.

2108
01:23:45.350 --> 01:23:47.950
So I called up Bernard, and he says, well, Richie,

2109
01:23:47.950 --> 01:23:49.060
how are you doing?

2110
01:23:49.060 --> 01:23:51.150
I says, Bernard, I have a problem with the drinking

2111
01:23:51.150 --> 01:23:52.480
