2113
01:23:54.630 --> 01:23:57.330
And he goes, I'll pick you up this evening.

2114
01:23:57.330 --> 01:24:00.733
So he came and he picked me up, and that's,

2115
01:24:00.733 --> 01:24:03.900
that was Labor Day 2010.

2116
01:24:03.900 --> 01:24:04.733
Right.

2117
01:24:04.733 --> 01:24:06.232
That's where I started.

2118
01:24:06.232 --> 01:24:07.065
