01:24:10.980 --> 01:24:14.283
He brings you into this whole other world,

2122
01:24:14.283 --> 01:24:18.371
and hence begins the slog into sobriety.

2123
01:24:18.371 --> 01:24:20.130
Yeah, it was really weird.

2124
01:24:20.130 --> 01:24:25.060
Like, I didn't know a whole lot about sobriety.

2125
