2127
01:24:30.130 --> 01:24:32.090
Like, you know, you wouldn't know shit about it.

2128
01:24:32.090 --> 01:24:35.129
Like even now what, the last few years.

2129
01:24:35.129 --> 01:24:36.406
So it must be weird in LA

2130
01:24:36.406 --> 01:24:37.650
