2133
01:24:40.317 --> 01:24:42.360
would be like fucking working the steps

2134
01:24:42.360 --> 01:24:43.860
in a restaurant with their sponsor.

2135
01:24:43.860 --> 01:24:45.580
That was so weird to me.

2136
