2233
01:28:26.830 --> 01:28:30.040
He had this fucking Santa Claus laugh, (hearty laughing)

2234
01:28:30.040 --> 01:28:32.530
like this, but he was just breaking my balls.

2235
01:28:32.530 --> 01:28:35.880
