because it takes courage to be vulnerable on that level.

2555
01:42:21.250 --> 01:42:22.083
Right?

2556
01:42:23.109 --> 01:42:25.630
But tapping into that vulnerability

2557
01:42:25.630 --> 01:42:28.020
becomes part of the healing process,

2558
01:42:28.020 --> 01:42:31.180
