2575
01:43:13.670 --> 01:43:16.060
Yeah, like for me, it didn't come easy to me.

2576
01:43:16.060 --> 01:43:19.570
Like, you know, I'm nearly 12 years sober now,

2577
01:43:19.570 --> 01:43:23.580
so I've told my story fucking at least 50 times

2578
