2595
01:44:09.739 --> 01:44:12.220
and I'm not proud of like a lot of the stuff I've done,

2596
01:44:12.220 --> 01:44:14.073
but it happened like, you know?

2597
01:44:14.073 --> 01:44:15.570
It's the truth.

2598
