And of course some people are gonna judge you.

2605
01:44:34.010 --> 01:44:34.843
It's not like,

2606
01:44:35.679 --> 01:44:39.470
things I have done aren't things to be proud of.

2607
01:44:39.470 --> 01:44:43.338
Like I'm lucky I'm not dead or in jail

2608
01:44:43.338 --> 01:44:47.670
for the things that I have done, but I'm being,

2609
01:44:47.670 --> 01:44:50.520
but when I'm asked to share at a group, I do

2610
01:44:50.520 --> 01:44:52.460
because it might help somebody else

2611
