who like maybe feels

2612
01:44:54.200 --> 01:44:56.701
like they're the biggest piece of shit in the room too.

2613
01:44:56.701 --> 01:44:57.700
Yeah.

2614
01:44:57.700 --> 01:44:59.279
Like or maybe they have something that they have done

2615
01:44:59.279 --> 01:45:01.010
that they're not proud of, you know?

2616
01:45:01.010 --> 01:45:05.280
How have you stayed plugged in after almost 12 years?

2617
01:45:05.280 --> 01:45:08.178
Cause you really embraced the program,

2618
01:45:08.178 --> 01:45:11.030
and you're an ambassador, you know,

2619
01:45:11.030 --> 01:45:15.050
in a very service forward way to a lot of people.

2620
01:45:15.050 --> 01:45:19.510
Yeah, so I had a bit of bad luck

2621
01:45:19.510 --> 01:45:21.440
