2622
01:45:21.440 --> 01:45:25.370
And so after I got sober,

2623
01:45:25.370 --> 01:45:28.090
I turned my back on criminal lifestyle,

2624
01:45:28.090 --> 01:45:29.680
completely out of it.

2625
01:45:29.680 --> 01:45:33.853
No more, no more drug dealing or any of that kinda stuff.

2626
01:45:34.701 --> 01:45:37.567
And I tried to switch my life around

2627
01:45:37.567 --> 01:45:39.780
and fucking get everything back on track.

2628
01:45:39.780 --> 01:45:41.263
I tried to fix my marriage,

2629
