You know, there's a few things wrong with me.

2672
01:47:42.162 --> 01:47:43.290
(both laughing)

2673
01:47:43.290 --> 01:47:46.005
So that just, you know, right, so yeah, I still,

2674
01:47:46.005 --> 01:47:49.070
