01:48:42.270 --> 01:48:43.883
I wanna play bad guys.

2701
01:48:43.883 --> 01:48:45.510
It was like, you look like a bad guy.

2702
01:48:45.510 --> 01:48:48.351
You'll play bad guys. (both laughing)

2703
01:48:48.351 --> 01:48:49.931
So that's how I.

2704
01:48:49.931 --> 01:48:51.390
And you've been at it for a while, man.

2705
01:48:51.390 --> 01:48:52.240
You're doing good.

2706
01:48:52.240 --> 01:48:56.910
Yeah, I've been in a lot of shows, and I enjoy it, yeah.

2707
01:48:56.910 --> 01:48:59.950
Yeah, the wife and the kids.

2708
01:48:59.950 --> 01:49:01.929
How's everything going there?

2709
01:49:01.929 --> 01:49:03.190
Ex-wife now.

2710
01:49:03.190 --> 01:49:04.587
I'm divorced.

2711
01:49:04.587 --> 01:49:07.328
I have a good relationship with my kids.

2712
