2713
01:49:10.200 --> 01:49:14.600
and they're teenagers now, and yeah,

2714
01:49:14.600 --> 01:49:16.140
I just try to be a good dad.

2715
01:49:16.140 --> 01:49:17.300
They live in San Francisco.

2716
01:49:17.300 --> 01:49:19.150
Yeah, they live with the ex-wife,

2717
01:49:19.150 --> 01:49:20.720
and it was kind of a weird one

2718
01:49:20.720 --> 01:49:25.480
because I had to tell them a bit about my story

