2720
01:49:29.030 --> 01:49:31.080
cause they were only babies when I got sober, so they.

2721
01:49:31.080 --> 01:49:35.900
But you're, I mean, it sounds like life for your wife

2722
01:49:35.900 --> 01:49:37.800
was an absolute living hell.

2723
01:49:37.800 --> 01:49:39.562
Oh yeah, like I'm sure

2724
01:49:39.562 --> 01:49:42.430
I was not fucking husband of the year

2725
01:49:42.430 --> 01:49:45.800
for any of those years or father of the year, you know?

2726
01:49:45.800 --> 01:49:48.470
Yeah, so obviously she won't have

2727
01:49:48.470 --> 01:49:49.690
that good of an opinion of me,

2728
01:49:49.690 --> 01:49:51.010
especially since we got divorced,

2729
01:49:51.010 --> 01:49:54.950
