It's on Amazon, Simon &amp; Schuster, Barnes &amp; Noble,

2979
02:00:35.670 --> 02:00:36.503
and Audible.

2980
02:00:36.503 --> 02:00:37.470
All the places, man.

2981
02:00:37.470 --> 02:00:40.795
So Audible, I wanted to ask, final thing.

2982
02:00:40.795 --> 02:00:43.030
Obviously you read the book, right?

2983
02:00:43.030 --> 02:00:44.249
Of course.

2984
02:00:44.249 --> 02:00:45.366
Yeah.

2985
02:00:45.366 --> 02:00:46.199
