That's a reason to get it on Audible right there.

2995
02:00:58.917 --> 02:01:00.954
Yeah, yeah, I hope you guys understand them.

2996
02:01:00.954 --> 02:01:02.630
No, it's good, man.

2997
02:01:02.630 --> 02:01:03.547
Cool.

2998
02:01:03.547 --> 02:01:05.557
The book is "The Gangster's Guide to Sobriety:

2999
